WEBVTT

00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:07.341
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where are you from?

00:00:08.352 --> 00:00:14.290
<v><b>Gastón:</b></v> I’m from Costa Rica, in Central America, but I live in Italy.

00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:16.599
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where were you born?

00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:21.586
<v><b>Gastón:</b></v> I was born in San José, the capital of Costa Rica.

00:00:22.385 --> 00:00:24.361
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What languages do you speak?

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:31.411
<v><b>Gastón:</b></v> I speak five languages: Spanish, which is my mother tongue;

00:00:32.214 --> 00:00:40.819
English, because I studied in a(n) English high school; French, which I learned at high school;

00:00:41.586 --> 00:00:49.273
Italian, because I live in Italy; and German, because of my passion for German music.

00:00:50.966 --> 00:00:52.874
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have any brothers and sisters?

00:00:53.835 --> 00:00:58.882
<v><b>Kateřina:</b></v> Yes, I have one sister that is two years younger than me

00:00:59.115 --> 00:01:02.490
and I have a brother that is fifteen years younger than me.

00:01:03.984 --> 00:01:05.251
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have any pets?

00:01:06.402 --> 00:01:08.358
<v><b>Kateřina:</b></v> No, unfortunately no.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:12.711
My kids are allergic, but I used to have a dog when I was a kid.

00:01:14.105 --> 00:01:16.136
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you get up during the week?

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.576
<v><b>Ollie:</b></v> I usually get up at about eight-thirty in the morning.

00:01:20.559 --> 00:01:22.640
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you usually go to bed?

00:01:22.913 --> 00:01:23.749
<v><b>Ollie:</b></v> It depends.

00:01:24.145 --> 00:01:27.431
During the week, um, at about eleven thirty.

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.165
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What kind of music do you listen to?

00:01:32.048 --> 00:01:35.600
<v><b>Hellen:</b></v> I like to listen to very different kinds of music.

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:42.676
I like from new age to heavy metal, from K-pop to blues, so it varies.

00:01:43.373 --> 00:01:45.674
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you do any sport or exercise?

00:01:46.199 --> 00:01:46.822
<v><b>Hellen:</b></v> Yes, I do.

00:01:46.823 --> 00:01:48.594
I’m a black belt in aikido.

00:01:48.929 --> 00:01:52.093
It’s a Japanese martial art, so I do it three times a week.

00:01:54.275 --> 00:01:56.062
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How often do you go to the cinema?

00:01:56.617 --> 00:02:00.166
<v><b>Mert:</b></v> I sometimes go to the cinema, but I prefer watching at home.

00:02:00.629 --> 00:02:02.197
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What did you do last weekend?

00:02:03.396 --> 00:02:09.240
<v><b>Mert:</b></v> Last weekend, on Saturday I went to Istanbul and on Sunday I met my friends.